  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd `examples/catalog/multiaxis/indexed` with an original pocketed block.\nThe case follows `examples/catalog/README.md`.\nInclude its mesh generator, mesh, build script, embedded project, NC program, and README.\nTwo pockets use A90 B0 and A-90 B0.\nThe third pocket uses A30 B30 on the sloped face.\nThe built-in `Tilt-head 5-axis` machine supplies the rotary axes.\nThe script verifies the operations before it saves or posts them.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe catalog had no indexed multiaxis case.\nExisting commands support the required operations with whole-model sources.\nThe compact block keeps the projected stock envelope within the tool's flute reach.\nThe work also found a separate false collision refusal, recorded in #3004 and linked on #2392.\nThis PR does not change verification code.\n\n## Tests\n\nValidation uses starting commit `58cb641caa0a4c0b6d514c3e874ccaee1b8a6e5b`.\n\nPins:\n\n- `catalog_multiaxis_indexed::regenerates`\n- `catalog_multiaxis_indexed::rebuilds`\n- `catalog_multiaxis_indexed::posts_two_single_axis_indexes_and_one_tilted_pocket`\n\nAll three pins failed before the case existed.\nAll three pass with the case.\nThe semantic pin checks pocket orientations, posted index words, cutting moves, and model portability.\n\nMutation results:\n\n- Remove the case to restore its absence on the starting main: all three pins fail. Restore it: all pass.\n- Change the project Front A90 to A89: the semantic pin fails, then passes after restoration.\n- Change the project Back A-90 to A-89: the semantic pin fails, then passes after restoration.\n- Change the project Tilted B30 to B0: the semantic pin fails, then passes after restoration.\n- Change the NC Front A90 to A89: the semantic pin fails, then passes after restoration.\n- Change the NC Back A-90 to A-89: the semantic pin fails, then passes after restoration.\n- Change the NC Tilted B30 to B0: the semantic pin fails, then passes after restoration.\n\nEach mutation restores the original file bytes.\nThe new case has no old file to restore with `git show`.\nNo production guard changed.\nThe model generator produces identical OBJ bytes on a second run.\n\nChecks:\n\n- `cargo xtask catalog --check`: all seven cases pass.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog`: all 22 tests pass.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green, against recorded base `58cb641ca`.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passes.\n\nThe run disabled the optional compile cache after its configured directory caused write errors.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nOne new golden: `examples/catalog/multiaxis/indexed/indexed.nc`, with 3,635 lines.\nThe diff adds the three operations and their A90/B0, A-90/B0, and A30/B30 index moves.\nNo existing NC or CL golden changed on this branch.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo physical CNC machine was run.\nThe example has no holder or fixture model.\nThe column stock simulator cannot judge posed operations.\nThe geometric gouge and collision checks run and have no blocking result for this case.\nVerification does not prove complete stock removal.\nThe cutter leaves material in sharp pocket corners.\n\nShared `upstream/main` advanced to `97a880c53` during this run.\nValidation did not exercise that newer main.\nIts cache stamp change requires project regeneration and a recheck before readiness.\nThis PR remains a draft.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #2963 touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nIt adds `catalog_2d_adaptive_pocket` in `crates/app/tests/example_catalog.rs`.\nThis PR adds `catalog_multiaxis_indexed` in that file.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: Add a portable indexed-pocket example with two single-axis indexes and one tilted face.\n\nFixes #2868\n",
